OL,3,GNEWSAWill another village 'roar' over
OL,4,Aasylum plans?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother English village could hold a
OL,7,Fsymbolic vote about leaving the UK in
OL,8,Fprotest at plans to house hundreds of
OL,9,Fasylum seekers nearby.
OL,11,FRAF Barnham in Suffolk might house up
OL,12,Fto 1,250 men as the government responds
OL,13,Fto a system "under significant strain".
OL,15,FA recent referendum saw villagers in
OL,16,FOxfordshire declaring the "Principality
OL,17,Fof Piddington" in response.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
